  "details": "When I receive a Boop while I'm offline, the notification only says that someone booped me. It doesn't show which Boop reaction or emoji was sent.\n\nIf I wasn't online when it happened, there's no way to know what the sender actually sent. This makes the feature feel incomplete and removes part of the fun of Boops.\n\nIt would be great if offline Boop notifications could preserve and display the original Boop reaction, or allow users to view the Boop details after logging in.\n\nScreenshot attached for reference.",
